WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.730
- We're about to play,
"Let's Make A Deal,"

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:05.880
to hopefully win some
money for these puppies

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.720
from Wagmore Pets, a dog rescue,

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.700
and you have a very special
connection with Wagmor.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:11.620
- I do.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:16.320
My latest Lord Chesterfield
was rescued from Wagmor.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.890
- Well, everyone knows
that I love a game show

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:19.723
and who doesn't?

00:00:19.723 --> 00:00:22.760
And what better way to
kick off Los Angeles Week

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:26.488
than a classic game show
"Let's Make A Deal."

00:00:26.488 --> 00:00:28.830
(audience applauding)

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.809
So, everybody, welcome Wayne Brady.

00:00:30.809 --> 00:00:35.809
(audience applauding)
(lively music)

00:00:37.431 --> 00:00:39.911
- Hi, Wayne Brady, pleasure.
- Gorgeous.

00:00:39.911 --> 00:00:41.836
- I know.
- Can you handle it?

00:00:41.836 --> 00:00:43.030
- Is that your dog, Jen?

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:44.990
- No, he could be yours though.

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:46.211
- Oh, no I already got four.

00:00:46.211 --> 00:00:47.044
I already have four.

00:00:47.044 --> 00:00:48.530
Hey, y'all.
- All right, Wayne.

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.670
Thank you for honoring
us with your presence.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:51.503
- Oh, it's my pleasure.

00:00:51.503 --> 00:00:53.870
- I just visited you
in your premiere week.

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:54.703
- Yes, Ma'am.

00:00:54.703 --> 00:00:55.930
- So thank you for coming today.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.550
Tell us what we are playing for.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:59.420
- All right, so, if you
know "Let's Make A Deal,"

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.680
you know that we love to
make a deal, of course.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:04.190
So we're gonna play a game
called "How Much Is Enough?"

00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:06.100
(audience applauding)

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:07.790
Now, easy-peasy game.

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:09.770
This first prize that you're playing for,

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:14.480
it is a picture of us on the
set of "Let's Make A Deal."

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.930
Now, do you keep this
picture, as amazing as it is,

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.720
and just walk away, it's yours,

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:21.930
or do you take a silver envelope?

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.210
And that silver envelope
will be brought into me by

00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:28.540
The Money Fairy, aka Chris
Ahearn, one of our producers.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:31.059
Thank you, Money Fairy.
(audience applauding)

00:01:31.059 --> 00:01:32.890
- With all due respect to both of us,

00:01:32.890 --> 00:01:35.130
I think I'm gonna go with the-
- Silver.

00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:35.963
- Yeah.
- Right?

00:01:35.963 --> 00:01:38.391
- Silver envelope, now, you
know, this could be a Zonk.

00:01:38.391 --> 00:01:40.420
- A Zonk.
- But it isn't.

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:42.500
It's $25,000.
(audience applauding)

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.700
- [Jennifer] Oh, my God!

00:01:45.428 --> 00:01:48.047
- So, you've got $25,000 for Wagmor.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.960
Now, you can keep your $25,000

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.080
and your picture and just walk away.

00:01:55.080 --> 00:01:58.060
Or you could take this gold envelope.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:01.362
If-
(audience applauding)

00:02:01.362 --> 00:02:03.650
If you decide to take the gold envelope

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.521
and there's a Zonk inside,
then you lose everything.

00:02:06.521 --> 00:02:08.310
(audience yelling answers)

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.720
- What do you say, I'd say-
- I'm gonna say-

00:02:09.720 --> 00:02:10.880
- [Wayne] That sounds like peer pressure.

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.570
- We're gonna go for yes, Wayne.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:13.760
Please, gosh.
- Okay.

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:15.560
Remember when I said
that if this was a Zonk,

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:17.110
you lose everything?
- Yes, we remember!

00:02:17.110 --> 00:02:18.250
- Okay.
(audience laughing)

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.000
I just got to reiterate.
- I know!

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:23.060
- Another $25,000!
- Oh, my God!

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:26.302
- Another $25,000 to Wagmor.
(audience applauding)

00:02:26.302 --> 00:02:28.552
You now have $50,000.
- Yes.

00:02:29.398 --> 00:02:32.680
(audience cheering)
- Plus the picture.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:35.110
Which I'm so happy that you
get that because I'm a dog dad,

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.040
I've got four dogs.

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:36.873
So, yay Wagmor!
- Yay!

00:02:37.770 --> 00:02:39.531
- Money Fairy, the big envelope, please.

00:02:39.531 --> 00:02:41.920
(audience applauding)
Thank you!

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.490
If this is a Zonk, you lose everything.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:46.480
So you can walk away right
now with your 50 grand.

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.640
- Remember, we talked about
not wanting to be greedy

00:02:49.640 --> 00:02:50.670
and not being ambitious.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:51.660
- Yes, I think we stick where we are.

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:52.760
- I do too.
- Stick it.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:54.259
- So you're passing on the envelope?

00:02:54.259 --> 00:02:55.092
- Oh, God!
- Oh, God, come on!

00:02:55.092 --> 00:02:55.925
- Yes, yes, yes, yes, yes!

00:02:55.925 --> 00:02:57.740
- Oh, my goodness.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.410
You guys have shot films
all over the world.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.230
Have you ever shot in Hungary?

00:03:03.230 --> 00:03:04.063
- No.
(puppy whining)

00:03:04.063 --> 00:03:07.500
No, he hates the idea.
- And I'm Hungarian.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:12.250
- Okay, because what you
passed on, this is a Zonk

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:16.610
and, little known that Zonk is actually

00:03:16.610 --> 00:03:20.017
the Hungarian translation of
"He's just not that into you."

00:03:20.017 --> 00:03:22.340
- Oh!
- So, congratulations!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.830
You missed out on a Zonk.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:27.031
Let's hear it for Wagmor!
(audience applauding)

00:03:27.031 --> 00:03:29.336
Miss Aniston, Drew, thank you.

00:03:29.336 --> 00:03:30.169
So nice to meet you.
- Thank you so much, pleasure.

00:03:30.169 --> 00:03:31.247
- Thank you, Wayne.

00:03:31.247 --> 00:03:34.100
Thank you so-
- That is so cute!

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.040
- Thank you so much.

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:39.210
That's $50,000 and-
- $50,000, that's amazing.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.043
- Would you like to hold?
- Sure!

00:03:40.043 --> 00:03:42.530
- Because, I mean you
just, by the way, come on.

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:46.380
- Don't pee on me, baby.
- I think it's good.

00:03:46.380 --> 00:03:48.010
All right, that's $50,000

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:50.593
and it'll go towards
Wagmor Pets Dog Rescue,

00:03:50.593 --> 00:03:52.100
(audience applauding)

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:55.250
which Jennifer Aniston has brought

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.260
to the forefront of our attention.

00:03:57.260 --> 00:04:00.390
It's an extraordinary
organization right here,

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:02.520
but you can support it from
all across the country.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:06.230
We wanna send a huge
thank you to The Wildest,

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.640
your go-to pet-parents site

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:12.140
and pet DNA-decoder, Wisdom Panel,

00:04:12.140 --> 00:04:17.140
for your donations in supporting
Wagmor Pets Dog Rescue.

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:20.460
Those are the two companies
that gave us the $25,000 today.

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:21.320
- Yay!
(audience applauding)

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:25.790
- And thank you so much
for supporting Wagmor!

00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:29.040
Go to TheDrewBarrymoreShow.com
to find out more information

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:33.810
on The Wildest, Wisdom Panel,
and Wagmor Pets Dog Rescue.

00:04:33.810 --> 00:04:37.017
And Wayne, thank you so much
for doing this with us and Jen.

00:04:37.017 --> 00:04:38.793
- Thanks for having me.
- Pleasure to see you, Wayne.

00:04:38.793 --> 00:04:42.773
- Be sure to check out "Let's
Make A Deal" today on CBS.

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:48.421
The morning show premieres
September 17th on Apple TV.

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:51.004
(bright music)

